From 58222ed1f745b94e989331eb60c7f448c8f7b92a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bvchess <53128914+bvchess@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 12:53:27 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 16/16] The example restricted's searches and walks end at
 their time limit: smooth-tree --exact stops its walk at --time-limit, the
 walk to the frontier (an error then), a subtree being walked (its counts so
 far kept, the estimates then lower bounds, the line's cut the subtrees
 stopped) and a leaf's search alike, and writes a JSON line on stderr for each
 subtree walked; the samples of smooth-tree are not begun after it, and a
 leaf's search stops at it

---
 solver/frame/examples/restricted.rs | 88 +++++++++++++++++++++--------
 1 file changed, 64 insertions(+), 24 deletions(-)

diff --git a/solver/frame/examples/restricted.rs b/solver/frame/examples/restricted.rs
index ab07fbb..9982204 100644
